+Add jitter to spread out simultaneous jobs
+~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
+
+.. code-block:: python
+
+    # runs every 10 minutes, plus a random 0-30 seconds delay each time
+    schedule.every(10).minutes.jitter(30).do(my_job)
+
 
